# ── Pipeline .gitignore ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rule: ignore RENDER OUTPUT and box dumps. Keep SOURCE-OF-TRUTH
# (master.csv, code, docs, canon/channel.json, reference plates, _skip.png).
# Never `git add -A`; add named paths.

# ---- render output (regenerable, large) ----
**/clips/
**/stills/
**/grid-b*/
**/thumb_candidates/
**/modea/
**/_shipped/
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/voiceover.mp3
**/_voice_part_*.mp3
**/vo_clips/
**/vo_map.json
**/voiceover.json
**/whisper*.json
**/narration.txt
**/beats.json
**/beats_full.json
**/engine_beats.json
**/storyboard.json
**/durations.json
**/_index.json

# ---- per-beat still candidates (grid) anywhere ----
**/[0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].png

# ---- box dumps / scratch (from the 20 Jul status) ----
*_from_box.json
*_from_box.md
/pipeline/
_hold_*/

# ---- python / env ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
venv/
*.pre_*

# ── EXPLICIT KEEPS (belt-and-braces; these are NOT ignored) ──
# master.csv is the film-as-data — always tracked
!**/master.csv
# reference plates + skip tile are small, durable assets
!**/characters/*.png
!shared/_skip.png
# canon / config
!**/channel.json
!**/canon.json
!**/rulebook.json

**/client_secret.json
**/token.json
**/channel_dump.json
**/*.credentials.json
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.obsidian/
*.docx

# ---- added 23 Jul 2026: secrets, media, editor projects, backups ----
secrets/
*.wfp
*.pptx
*.jpeg
*.mp3
*/music/
*/batch_inbox/
*.bak_*
*.bak-*
success-coach/new_thumbs/
crew-wip/
packaging/reverts/
packaging/thumb_map.csv

*.db
